AetherEngine scrub-preview decoder budget and in-flight accounting (AE#1059)

https://github.com/superuser404notfound/AetherEngine/commit/08993d94a240b18f68a386feab3a026a356284cd
https://github.com/superuser404notfound/AetherEngine/commit/5b48147fd409732ed8e12d6844744a9b666c665f

Close older native segment decoders without invalidating their held stills.
Serialize budget admission through decode for the shared segment pool and
reuse the existing serial context-close gate. Keep the host's stronger
cleanup, playback cancellation, and preview-lane policy.

